#: CrossSectionAnalysis/Resources/UI/CrossSectionAnalysis.ui:1232
msgctxt "CrossSectionAnalysis"
msgid ""
"Circular equivalent (CE) diameter: that of a circle having the surface area of the cross-section.\n"
"\n"
